', 'text/plain');
INSERT INTO files (area_id, filename, descr, size, uploader, uploaded_at, status, free, content, ctype) VALUES (13, 'L33TGUID.TXT', 'How 2 B 3L33T: a guide for newbies', 444, 'SysOp', 1792371656037, 'approved', 1, ' H0W 2 B 3L33T - lesson 1

 1. Alternate CaPs. iT LoOkS MoRe ElItE tHaT wAy.
 2. Replace letters: a=4, e=3, i=1, o=0, s=5, t=7. Use sparingly. Or always.
 3. Everything is a ''z''. Filez. Gamez. Utilz. Pizzaz.
 4. Never admit you use a 2400 baud modem.
 5. Your handle must include at least one of: DARK, SHADOW, DEATH, ACID.
 6. End every message with a quote from Hackers (1995).
 7. Upload. The real elite upload. Leeches stay lamers forever.
', 'text/plain');
